Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:36:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 92/93] temp/qsee-supplicant: new package, with an RPMB
 listener

Machine-wide supplicant and application loader for QSEECOM trusted
applications. Adds the RPMB listener (0x2000) that Gatekeeper needs and
lets GPFS requests use the whole shared buffer (fingerprint templates).
