+Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gpfs: accept requests up to the shared buffer size
+
+QSEE sizes GPFS data chunks from the registered buffer, not from
+QS_GPFS_DATA_SIZE: with the 504 KiB buffer it sends 515824-byte
+chunks (Goodix fingerprint templates are ~545 KB). The remaining checks
+already bound the length by the actual buffer size.
